          <p>Sanaa Syed is our dedicated coordinator at Meaningful Psychiatry! She is on her way to becoming an MD herself, and a future budding psychiatrist, and we are so happy to have her here as your first point of contact at Meaningful Psychiatry!</p>
          <p>Sanaa currently holds a B.S. in Informatics (Biomedical &amp; Health Systems) and a minor in Bioethics from the University of Washington Seattle. Because of her academic background and experience, Sanaa brings a holistic understanding of medicine, where data, ethics, and humanity intersect.</p>
          <p>She coordinates patient care with thoughtfulness and intentionality, managing intake and scheduling, guiding patients through the administrative journey, ensuring seamless communication between patients and provider, and creating an environment where every individual feels welcomed and heard.</p>
        </div>
