      <div class="member__body">
        <p>Sanaa’s diverse clinical foundation spans pediatric research at Seattle Children’s Research Institute, patient services and care coordination at Kaiser Permanente, behavioral health therapy with children and families at Kids and Family Counseling, and clinical project coordination at UW Medicine. Her research on post-kidney transplant care was published in the Journal of the American Medical Informatics Association in 2024.</p>
        <p>We are so excited to have Sanaa onboard as part of our team here at Meaningful Psychiatry. Welcome aboard Sanaa!</p>
